### OAuth2 token request
POST https://identity.example.com/oauth2/token
Authorization: Basic Y2xpZW50LTE6c2VjcmV0LTE=
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&scope=api

### Bearer downstream
GET https://api.example.com/users
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Literal basic
GET https://api.example.com/basic
Authorization: Basic YWxpY2U6cGFzcw==

### Basic two variables
GET https://api.example.com/twovar
Authorization: Basic {{userName}} {{passWord}}

### Untouched bearer header (literal token)
GET https://api.example.com/literal
Authorization: Bearer abc123
